data: {"answer": "這裡有壁爐近看・點餐平板，是服務生用於桌邊點餐的共用裝置。請務必確保桌面與螢幕淨空、設定閒置登出並使用個人帳號登入，以防範偷窺與螢幕外露風險。房間內藏有一個資安漏洞待你發現，目前進度顯示尚未找到。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "點餐平板是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Ordering Tablet do?", "zh": "點餐平板是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "偷窺與螢幕外露要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent shoulder surfing & screen exposure?", "zh": "偷窺與螢幕外露要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.47, "total_s": 8.48}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "hall_fire", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "hall_fire"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.4}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "hall_fire", "label": "Room", "en": "Fireplace · Up Close", "zh": "壁爐近看"}, {"key": "order_tablet", "label": "System", "en": "Ordering Tablet", "zh": "點餐平板"}, {"key": "shoulder_surfing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Shoulder Surfing & Screen Exposure", "zh": "偷窺與螢幕外露"}, {"key": "clear_desk", "label": "Control", "en": "Clear Desk & Clear Screen", "zh": "桌面淨空與螢幕淨空"}, {"key": "session_lock", "label": "Control", "en": "Screen Lock & Session Timeout", "zh": "螢幕鎖定與閒置登出"}, {"key": "unique_ids", "label": "Control", "en": "Individual Accounts (No Shared Logins)", "zh": "個人帳號（不共用）"}], "edges": [{"a": "order_tablet", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "hall_fire"}, {"a": "shoulder_surfing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "hall_fire"}, {"a": "unique_ids", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_fire"}, {"a": "unique_ids", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "order_tablet"}, {"a": "unique_ids", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "shoulder_surfing"}, {"a": "session_lock", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_fire"}, {"a": "session_lock", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "order_tablet"}, {"a": "session_lock", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "shoulder_surfing"}, {"a": "clear_desk", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "hall_fire"}, {"a": "clear_desk", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "shoulder_surfing"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：壁爐近看・點餐平板\n代表的資訊主題：服務生在桌邊點餐用的共用平板。\n重點：共用裝置要自動鎖定，每個人用自己的帳號登入。\n這裡的系統：點餐平板\n這裡要注意的威脅：偷窺與螢幕外露\n看得到的防護措施：桌面淨空與螢幕淨空、螢幕鎖定與閒置登出、個人帳號（不共用）\n這個房間藏著 1 個資安漏洞（要玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：餐廳收銀系統", "converted_to_traditional": true, "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.47, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 569, "prompt_s": 2.29, "gen_tokens": 71, "gen_s": 6.15, "tok_per_s": 11.5, "first_token_s": 2.31}}, "state": {}}

